    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d901">

                <pb facs="0934" n="922" sameAs="frus:frus1945v08/pg922"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.79600/7–545: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in Saudi
                        Arabia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Eddy</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-07-05T18:00:00-04:00">July 5, 1945—6
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>188. You may convey to Saudi authorities info in Depcirtel July 5,<anchor n="49"
                        xml:id="d901-f1"/> emphasizing that establishment such services through
                    Saudi Arabia is of course dependent on the rights we hope to obtain. Also state
                    that if agreeable to King we are ready to submit draft bilateral civil air
                    transport agreement similar to those now being negotiated with other countries.
                    Please inform whether we should forward you such draft agreement at this
                    time.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Byrnes</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
